@startuml
skin rose
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title Document ownership

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "editorDocument\ncanonical writable text" as doc
component "editorRope\nchunked byte storage" as rope
component "line index\nbyte offsets per line" as index
component "struct erow\nrender cache" as row
component "byte offsets\ncursor, search, selection" as offsets
component "syntax + LSP\ntab-local" as lang

doc *-- rope : owns
doc *-- index : owns
doc --> row : derives
doc --> offsets : positions index into
doc --> lang : edits and reads

note bottom of doc
  Single source of truth.
  Everything below the document
  is derived or indexed into it,
  and is rebuilt on each edit.
end note

@enduml
